    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Penne con tonno e olive is a pasta that should be entirely possible from what is already in the cupboard. The sauce takes 15 minutes while the pasta cooks. Use tuna in olive oil rather than brine: the oil carries flavour. The olives and capers give the sauce its character, so do not reduce their quantities."
          }
        ]
      },
